# P00 additions. Local tool output and capture artifacts. These rules only
# protect new untracked files: anything already tracked or already committed
# stays exposed, and python3 tools/privacy_audit.py still reports it. See
# plan/privacy.md and tests/README.md.
/probe.json
/drive-shots/
/.obsidian/
